    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability API enables seamless porting of mobile numbers from one service provider to another, facilitating a smooth transition for users. This endpoint allows authorized clients to submit requests for SIM portability, ensuring that customer data is transferred accurately and efficiently. Typical consumers include telecom service providers and mobile application developers who need to integrate number portability functionality into their services. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance customer satisfaction through improved service flexibility.",
